cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or processed data, please cite this release."
type: software
title: "Mediator activation-domain–Tail analysis: processed data and code"
abstract: >-
  Frozen processed source data and deterministic Python validation, summary,
  and plotting code supporting quantitative analyses of activation-domain
  engagement with the human Mediator Tail in the accompanying Mediator
  manuscript. The release uses processed inputs, contains no AF3 atomic
  coordinates, and does not include upstream structural-analysis code.
